{"nota":"Diccionario ES→EN. El inglés se genera con tools\\i18n.ps1 generar; no editar el .en.js a mano. keep: textos que no se traducen.","lit":{"\u0027 \u003cstrong\u003eNota:\u003c/strong\u003e para elementos superpesados la configuración mostrada debe considerarse un modelo/predicción educativa.\u0027":"\" \u003cstrong\u003eNote:\u003c/strong\u003e for superheavy elements the configuration shown should be considered an educational model/prediction.\"","\u0027 Para este elemento, el estado fundamental aceptado requiere una redistribución respecto de este llenado Aufbau simple; compárala con la pestaña Configurar.\u0027":"\" For this element, the accepted ground state requires a redistribution relative to this simple Aufbau filling; compare it with the Configure tab.\"","`¿A qué bloque pertenece ${e.name}?`":"`What block is ${e.name}?`","`¿Cuál es la configuración completa de ${e.symbol}?`":"`What is the complete configuration of ${e.symbol}?`","`¿Cuál es la configuración reducida de ${e.name} (${e.symbol})?`":"`What is the condensed configuration of ${e.name} (${e.symbol})?`","`¿Cuántos electrones desapareados presenta ${e.symbol} en este modelo?`":"`How many unpaired electrons does ${e.symbol} have in this model?`","`\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGrupo:\u003c/strong\u003e ${e.group??\u0027—\u0027} · \u003cstrong\u003ePeríodo:\u003c/strong\u003e ${e.period} · \u003cstrong\u003eBloque:\u003c/strong\u003e ${e.block}\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCategoría:\u003c/strong\u003e ${e.category}\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eElectrones externos:\u003c/strong\u003e ${e.outerElectrons}\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubnivel diferenciador:\u003c/strong\u003e ${lastSubshell(c)}\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComportamiento magnético (modelo):\u003c/strong\u003e ${u?\u0027paramagnético (\u0027+u+\u0027 desapareado\u0027+(u!==1?\u0027s\u0027:\u0027\u0027)+\u0027)\u0027:\u0027diamagnético\u0027}\u003c/p\u003e`":"`\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGroup:\u003c/strong\u003e ${e.group??\u0027—\u0027} · \u003cstrong\u003ePeriod:\u003c/strong\u003e ${e.period} · \u003cstrong\u003eBlock:\u003c/strong\u003e ${e.block}\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCategory:\u003c/strong\u003e ${e.category}\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOuter electrons:\u003c/strong\u003e ${e.outerElectrons}\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDifferentiating subshell:\u003c/strong\u003e ${lastSubshell(c)}\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMagnetic behavior (model):\u003c/strong\u003e ${u?\"paramagnetic (\"+u+\" unpaired\"+(u!==1?\u0027s\u0027:\u0027\u0027)+\u0027)\u0027:\"diamagnetic\"}\u003c/p\u003e`","`✗ No todavía. La respuesta correcta es \u003cstrong\u003e${pretty(quiz.answer)}\u003c/strong\u003e.`":"`✗ Not yet. The correct answer is \u003cstrong\u003e${pretty(quiz.answer)}\u003c/strong\u003e.`","`período ${e.period}`":"`period ${e.period}`","`Se han colocado ${n} electrones siguiendo el orden energético. El subnivel activo es ${active}.`":"`Placed ${n} electrons following the energy order. The active subshell is ${active}.`","\u0027\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguración excepcional:\u003c/strong\u003e el estado fundamental utilizado difiere del llenado Aufbau simple cerca de los subniveles de frontera.\u0027":"\"\u003cstrong\u003eExceptional configuration:\u003c/strong\u003e the ground state used differs from the simple Aufbau filling near the boundary subshells.\"","\u0027✓ Correcto.\u0027":"\"✓ Correct.\"","\u0027Átomo neutro.\u0027":"\"Neutral atom.\"","\u0027Comienza colocando el primer electrón en 1s.\u0027":"\"Start by placing the first electron in 1s.\"","\u0027comienza en 1s\u0027":"\"starts at 1s\"","\u0027Completo\u0027":"\"Complete\"","\u0027Construyendo\u0027":"\"Building\"","\u0027diamagnético\u0027":"\"diamagnetic\"","\u0027La carga elegida queda fuera del rango electrónico manejado por esta versión.\u0027":"\"The chosen charge is outside the electron range handled by this version.\"","\u0027La configuración coincide con el esquema Aufbau usado por el simulador.\u0027":"\"The configuration matches the Aufbau scheme used by the simulator.\"","\u0027Los electrones añadidos se colocaron siguiendo el orden energético y la capacidad de los subniveles del modelo.\u0027":"\"The added electrons were placed following the energy order and the subshell capacities of the model.\"","\u0027Mostrar hasta subnivel final\u0027":"\"Show up to final subshell\"","\u0027Ocultar subnivel siguiente\u0027":"\"Hide next subshell\"","\u0027Para formar el catión se retiraron electrones empezando por el nivel principal ocupado más alto; esto reproduce la regla escolar de retirar ns antes que (n−1)d en metales de transición.\u0027":"\"To form the cation, electrons were removed starting from the highest occupied principal level; this reproduces the school rule of removing ns before (n−1)d in transition metals.\"","\u0027paramagnético\u0027":"\"paramagnetic\"","\u0027Respuesta correcta: \u003cstrong\u003e\u0027":"\"Correct answer: \u003cstrong\u003e\"","\u0027se respeta capacidad y espín\u0027":"\"capacity and spin are respected\""},"lines":{},"keep":["`\u003cdiv class=\"aufbau-cell ${k===active?\u0027current\u0027:\u0027\u0027}\"\u003e${k}\u003c/div\u003e`","`\u003cdiv class=\"subshell\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"subshell-label\"\u003e${k}\u003csup\u003e${n}\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"boxes\"\u003e${arr.map(x=\u003e`","`\u003clabel class=\"quiz-option\"\u003e\u003cinput type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz\" value=\"${encodeURIComponent(o)}\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e${pretty(o)}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/label\u003e`","`\u003coption value=\"${e.z}\"\u003e${e.z} · ${e.symbol} · ${e.name}\u003c/option\u003e`","\u0027\u003cspan class=\"spin-dn\"\u003e↓\u003c/span\u003e\u0027","\u0027\u003cspan class=\"spin-up\"\u003e↑\u003c/span\u003e\u0027","\u0027feedback good\u0027"]}